  data: {
    LLM: "Understand your target and play accordingly. If you need 9 tricks as dealer, you need a very strong hand. If you need only 2, you can play more defensively.\n\nCard exchange strategy: When giving cards to opponents who were down, give them cards that don't help their hand. When receiving cards, you must give back your highest of that suitâ€”manage your hand to minimize losses.\n\nTrack which cards have been exchanged to deduce opponents' holdings. Coordinate your play based on who needs to win tricks vs who is trying to avoid winning tricks.",
